# Force HTTPS: instruct browsers to only ever connect over TLS (mirrors the
# marketing site). The HTTP→HTTPS redirect itself is the Cloudflare zone
# "Always Use HTTPS" setting.
#
# Hardening (2026-10-04). Nothing in the suite frames this app (checked: the
# hub, the website, the SDK), and the app only ever frames its OWN blob: and
# storage URLs, which these don't govern — so refusing to be framed elsewhere
# costs nothing and closes off click-jacking the Send-to-sign and account
# actions. No Permissions-Policy: Scan needs the camera.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self'
